{"type":"message","id":"941095ea","parentId":"46c158cd","timestamp":"2026-04-19T09:20:59.826Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想要把我们刚才讨论的内容做成一个 HTML 文档。我需要：\n\n1. 创建一个美观的 HTML 文档\n2. 包含我们讨论的 TEE + 加密执行的完整实现思路\n3. 包含架构图、代码示例、对比表格等\n4. 样式要现代、简洁\n\n我会创建一个完整的 HTML 文件，包含所有内容和样式。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，我来给你创建一个完整的 HTML 文档，包含我们讨论的 TEE + 加密执行实现方案 📄"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bnhymh5zbke0g7kdstsk73w9","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-codus/skill-tee.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>TEE + 加密执行 - Skill 资产化实现方案</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #333;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-size: 2.5em;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        header p {\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        nav {\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n            padding: 20px 40px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;\n            position: sticky;\n            top: 0;\n            z-index: 100;\n        }\n\n        nav ul {\n            list-style: none;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            gap: 15px;\n        }\n\n        nav a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: #667eea;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n\n        nav a:hover {\n            background: #667eea;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        main {\n            padding: 40px;\n        }\n\n        section {\n            margin-bottom: 60px;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: 2em;\n            color: #1a1a2e;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 3px solid #667eea;\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: 1.5em;\n            color: #333;\n            margin: 30px 0 15px;\n        }\n\n        .diagram {\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n            border: 2px dashed #667eea;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 30px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            overflow-x: auto;\n        }\n\n        .code-block {\n            background: #1e1e1e;\n            color: #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            overflow-x: auto;\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n        }\n\n        .code-block .keyword { color: #569cd6; }\n        .code-block .string { color: #ce9178; }\n        .code-block .comment { color: #6a9955; }\n        .code-block .function { color: #dcdcaa; }\n        .code-block .number { color: #b5cea8; }\n\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        th, td {\n            padding: 15px;\n            text-align: left;\n            border: 1px solid #e9ecef;\n        }\n\n        th {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        tr:nth-child(even) {\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n        }\n\n        .challenge-box {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd 0%, #ffeaa7 100%);\n            border-left: 4px solid #f39c12;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .flow-diagram {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin: 30px 0;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        .flow-box {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 20px 30px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            min-width: 150px;\n        }\n\n        .flow-arrow {\n            font-size: 2em;\n            color: #667eea;\n        }\n\n        .feature-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin: 30px 0;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);\n            padding: 25px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;\n        }\n\n        .feature-card h4 {\n            color: #667eea;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background: #1a1a2e;\n            color: white;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #667eea;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 5px 15px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 0.85em;\n            margin: 5px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            header h1 { font-size: 1.8em; }\n            main { padding: 20px; }\n            nav { padding: 15px 20px; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>🔐 TEE + 加密执行</h1>\n            <p>Skill 资产化实现方案</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <nav>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"#overview\">TEE 原理</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#comparison\">方案对比</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#architecture\">完整架构</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#workflow\">工作流程</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#code\">代码实现</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#attestation\">远程证明</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#challenges\">挑战与方案</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n\n        <main>\n            <section id=\"overview\">\n                <h2>一、TEE 核心原理</h2>\n                \n                <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <h4>📍 硬件级隔离</h4>\n                        <p>代码在 Enclave 内解密运行，OS/管理员都无法窥探</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <h4>📍 远程证明</h4>\n                        <p>可验证代码未被篡改 (Remote Attestation)</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <h4>📍 密钥隔离</h4>\n                        <p>密钥只在 Enclave 内可见，泄露风险极低</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"diagram\">\n<pre>\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      普通世界 (Rich OS)                      │\n│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐        │\n│  │   App A     │  │   App B     │  │  Agent Core │        │\n│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                    ┌─────────┴─────────┐\n                    │   TEE Interface   │\n                    └─────────┬─────────┘\n                              │\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     安全世界 (TEE)                           │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │              Enclave / Secure World                  │   │\n│  │  ┌───────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐              │   │\n│  │  │  Skill Code   │  │   Key Store   │              │   │\n│  │  │  (解密后运行) │  │  (私钥隔离)   │              │   │\n│  │  └───────────────┘  └───────────────┘              │   │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                      ↑ 硬件级隔离                            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</pre>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section id=\"comparison\">\n                <h2>二、主流 TEE 方案对比</h2>\n                \n                <table>\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>方案</th>\n                            <th>厂商</th>\n                            <th>特点</th>\n                            <th>适用场景</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>Intel SGX</strong></td>\n                            <td>Intel</td>\n                            <td>最成熟，Enclave 粒度细</td>\n                            <td>云服务器、高性能</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>ARM TrustZone</strong></td>\n                            <td>ARM</td>\n                            <td>移动端首选，低功耗</td>\n                            <td>手机、IoT</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>AMD SEV</strong></td>\n                            <td>AMD</td>\n                            <td>VM 级别隔离</td>\n                            <td>云 VM</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>SGX DCAP</strong></td>\n                            <td>Intel</td>\n                            <td>免 Intel IDK 依赖</td>\n                            <td>简化部署</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </section>\n\n            <section id=\"architecture\">\n                <h2>三、完整实现架构</h2>\n                \n                <h3>1. 架构概览</h3>\n                <div class=\"diagram\">\n<pre>\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        Skill 开发者                              │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  ① 编写 Skill (TypeScript/Python)                               │\n│  ② 加密 → 上传 IPFS                                             │\n│  ③ Mint NFT + 注册到链上合约                                     │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      TEE 硬件环境                                │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │\n│  │                  Skill Execution Enclave                │    │\n│  │  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐  │    │\n│  │  │ Attestation │  │   Decrypt   │  │   Skill Runtime │  │    │\n│  │  │   Service   │  │   Module    │  │   (沙箱执行)    │  │    │\n│  │  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────────┘  │    │\n│  │                                                          │    │\n│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐│    │\n│  │  │              Private Key (sealed inside)            ││    │\n│  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘│    │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        区块链                                   │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  • SkillRegistry: 权限管理 + 使用记录                           │\n│  • NFT: 所有权 + 版权收益                                       │\n│  • Payment: USDC/ETH 支付 + 自动分成                            │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</pre>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section id=\"workflow\">\n                <h2>四、工作流程</h2>\n                \n                <h3>Skill 加密与上链</h3>\n                <div class=\"flow-diagram\">\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">编写 Skill</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">加密 + 签名</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">上传 IPFS</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">链上注册</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3>Agent 加载执行</h3>\n                <div class=\"flow-diagram\">\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">验证使用权</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">获取加密 Skill</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">远程证明</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">TEE 执行</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-box\">链上记录</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section id=\"code\">\n                <h2>五、代码实现</h2>\n                \n                <h3>1. Skill 加密与上链 (TypeScript)</h3>\n                <div class=\"code-block\">\n<pre><span class=\"comment\">// ===== 开发者端：Skill 打包加密 =====</span>\n\n<span class=\"keyword\">import</span> { createEnclave, seal } <span class=\"keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"string\">'@intel/sgx-sdk'</span>;\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 1. Skill 代码结构</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> SkillPackage {\n    code: Buffer;           <span class=\"comment\">// 原始代码</span>\n    schema: SkillSchema;   <span class=\"comment\">// 输入/输出格式</span>\n    version: <span class=\"keyword\">string</span>;\n    dependencies: <span class=\"keyword\">string</span>[];\n}\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 2. 生成 Enclave 测量值 (用于后续验证)</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">const</span> enclave = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> createEnclave(<span class=\"string\">'./skill_enclave.signed.so'</span>);\n<span class=\"keyword\">const</span> measurement = enclave.getMeasurement(); <span class=\"comment\">// MRENCLAVE</span>\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 3. 用 Enclave 公钥加密 Skill</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">const</span> skillKey = crypto.randomBytes(<span class=\"number\">32</span>);\n<span class=\"keyword\">const</span> encryptedSkill = encryptAESGCM(skill.code, skillKey);\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 4. 用开发者密钥签名</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">const</span> signature = signMessage({\n    encryptedSkill,\n    metadata: skill.schema,\n    enclaveMeasurement: measurement\n});\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 5. 上传 IPFS + 链上注册</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">const</span> ipfsCid = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> ipfs.upload(encryptedSkill);\n<span class=\"keyword\">await</span> skillRegistry.register(ipfsCid, skill.schema, measurement, {\n    usageFee: parseUSDC(<span class=\"string\">'0.01'</span>),\n    royaltyBps: <span class=\"number\">500</span>  <span class=\"comment\">// 5%</span>\n});</pre>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3>2. TEE Enclave 内代码 (C)</h3>\n                <div class=\"code-block\">\n<pre><span class=\"comment\">// ===== Enclave 内：skill_enclave.c =====</span>\n\n<span class=\"keyword\">#include</span> <span class=\"string\">\"enclave.h\"</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">#include</span> <span class=\"string\">\"skill_runtime.h\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 密封的 Skill 密钥 (只有当前 Enclave 能解密)</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">struct</span> sealed_key_t {\n    <span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span> key[<span class=\"number\">32</span>];\n    <span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span> iv[<span class=\"number\">12</span>];\n} sealed_key;\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// 远程证明验证</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">extern bool</span> verify_attestation(<span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span>* quote, <span class=\"keyword\">size_t</span> quote_len);\n\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skill 执行入口</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">public int</span> execute_skill(\n    <span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span>* encrypted_skill, \n    <span class=\"keyword\">size_t</span> skill_size,\n    <span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span>* input_data,\n    <span class=\"keyword\">size_t</span> input_size,\n    <span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span>** output_data,\n    <span class=\"keyword\">size_t</span>* output_size\n) {\n    <span class=\"comment\">// 1. 验证调用者身份 (通过 Attestation)</span>\n    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (!verify_attestation(attestation_quote, quote_len)) {\n        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> SGX_ERROR_INVALID_ATTESTATION;\n    }\n    \n    <span class=\"comment\">// 2. 解密 Skill 代码 (密钥从 sealed storage 恢复)</span>\n    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (!unseal_key(&sealed_key)) {\n        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> SGX_ERROR_UNSEAL_FAILED;\n    }\n    \n    <span class=\"keyword\">uint8_t</span>* skill_code = decrypt_aes_gcm(\n        encrypted_skill, \n        skill_size, \n        sealed_key.key\n    );\n    \n    <span class=\"comment\">// 3. 沙箱执行 Skill</span>\n    sandbox_config_t config = {\n        .memory_limit = <span class=\"number\">256</span> * <span class=\"number\">1024</span> * <span class=\"number\">1024</span>,  <span class=\"comment\">// 256MB</span>\n        .timeout_ms = <span class=\"number\">30000</span>,\n        .network_access = <span class=\"keyword\">false</span>,\n        .filesystem_access = <span class=\"keyword\">false</span>\n    };\n    \n    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> sandbox_execute(skill_code, input_data, input_size, \n                          output_data, output_size, &config);\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3>3. Agent 运行时调用 (TypeScript)</h3>\n                <div class=\"code-block\">\n<pre><span class=\"comment\">// ===== Agent 端：加载使用 Skill =====</span>\n\n<span class=\"keyword\">class</span> TEESkillLoader {\n    <span class=\"keyword\">private</span> enclave: EnclaveClient;\n    <span class=\"keyword\">private</span> registry: SkillRegistry;\n    \n    <span class=\"keyword\">async</span> loadAndExecute(\n        skillId: <span class=\"keyword\">string</span>, \n        input: <span class=\"keyword\">unknown</span>\n    ): Promise&lt;<span class=\"keyword\">unknown</span>&gt; {\n        \n        <span class=\"comment\">// 1. 购买/验证使用权</span>\n        <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> { fee, ipfsCid } = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"keyword\">this</span>.registry.buyUsage(skillId);\n        \n        <span class=\"comment\">// 2. 从 IPFS 获取加密的 Skill</span>\n        <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> encryptedSkill = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> ipfs.cat(ipfsCid);\n        \n        <span class=\"comment\">// 3. 创建远程证明 (RA)</span>\n        <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> attestation = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"keyword\">this</span>.enclave.createAttestation({\n            challenge: crypto.randomBytes(<span class=\"number\">32</span>),\n            requestedPermissions: [<span class=\"string\">'execute'</span>]\n        });\n        \n        <span class=\"comment\">// 4. 发送到 TEE 执行</span>\n        <span class=\"keyword\">const</span> result = <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"keyword\">this</span>.enclave.invoke(<span class=\"string\">'execute_skill'</span>, {\n            encryptedSkill: encryptedSkill.buffer,\n            inputData: JSON.stringify(input),\n            attestation: attestation.quote\n        });\n        \n        <span class=\"comment\">// 5. 记录使用 (链上)</span>\n        <span class=\"keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"keyword\">this</span>.registry.recordUsage(skillId, fee);\n        \n        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> result;\n    }\n}</pre>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section id=\"attestation\">\n                <h2>六、远程证明 (RA) 流程</h2>\n                \n                <p>这是确保「运行的是可信代码」的关键：</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"diagram\">\n<pre>\n┌─────────┐                              ┌─────────┐\n│  Agent  │                              │  TEE    │\n└────┬────┘                              └────┬────┘\n     │                                           │\n     │  1. Challenge (nonce)                     │\n     │──────────────────────────────────────────►│\n     │                                           │\n     │  2. RA Quote (含 Enclave 哈希)            │\n     │◄──────────────────────────────────────────│\n     │                                           │\n     │            3. 验证 Quote                   │\n     │  ┌────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n     │  │ • 签名 Intel/AMD CA 验证            │  │\n     │  │ • MRENCLAVE 比对 (代码指纹)         │  │\n     │  │ • Challenge 防重放                  │  │\n     │  └────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n     │                                           │\n     │  4. 建立安全通道 (Sealed Key 交换)        │\n     │──────────────────────────────────────────►│\n     │                                           │\n</pre>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <h4>✓ 签名验证</h4>\n                        <p>Intel/AMD CA 证书验证，确保 TEE 硬件真实</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <h4>✓ 代码指纹</h4>\n                        <p>MRENCLAVE 比对，确保运行的代码未被篡改</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feature-card\">\n                        <h4>✓ 防重放</h4>\n                        <p>Challenge 机制，防止旧 Quote 重放攻击</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section id=\"challenges\">\n                <h2>七、挑战与解决方案</h2>\n                \n                <table>\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>挑战</th>\n                            <th>解决方案</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>TEE 硬件成本</strong></td>\n                            <td>初期可用 Intel SGX 支持的云实例 (AWS c6i, GCP n2d)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>性能开销</strong></td>\n                            <td>Enclave 启动有 ~100ms 延迟，Skill 可缓存复用</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>密钥管理</strong></td>\n                            <td>用 SGX Sealing 持久化密钥，配合 KMS 热备份</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>开发体验</strong></td>\n                            <td>提供 SDK 封装，让 Skill 开发者无感使用 TEE</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <h3>快速原型建议</h3>\n                \n                <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n                    <h4>🟢 简化版 (MVP)</h4>\n                    <p>用 Web Crypto API 加密 → 链下中心化 Enclave 执行</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"challenge-box\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1ecf1 0%, #bee5eb 100%); border-left-color: #17a2b8;\">\n                    <h4>🟡 进阶版</h4>\n                    <p>用 Intel SGX SDK 写一个最小 Enclave</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"challenge-box\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%); border-left-color: #28a745;\">\n                    <h4>🟢 生产版</h4>\n                    <p>结合 Graphene/LibOS 兼容现有 Skill 代码</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section>\n                <h2>技术栈推荐</h2>\n                <div style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n                    <span class=\"badge\">Intel SGX</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">IPFS</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">Solidity</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">Foundry</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">TypeScript</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">Graphene LibOS</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">AWS c6i</span>\n                    <span class=\"badge\">USDC</span>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>🔗 Skill 资产化 - TEE + 加密执行实现方案</p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 10px; opacity: 0.7;\">文档生成日期: 2026-04-19</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776590370263,"responseId":"0217765903704875dc9aa6c4e6a4204292e30580ff3cb0e2988b0"}}
