{"type":"message","id":"5ba2752e","parentId":"121ff4ea","timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:35:01.861Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想要更详细的 TEE + 加密执行实现方案，包括：\n1. TEE 选型\n2. 核心机制\n3. 如何连接业务\n\n这是一个更深入的技术问题，我需要给出更详细的技术方案，包括：\n- TEE 技术选型的详细对比\n- 每个 TEE 的核心机制\n- 业务集成的完整架构\n- 可能的代码示例\n\n让我提供一个更详细的方案。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，我来给你一份更详细的 TEE + 加密执行实现方案，包括技术选型、核心机制和业务集成 🛠️\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_di3oimez1d151756fl6rt1or","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-codus/TEE_IMPLEMENTATION_DETAIL.md","content":"# TEE + 加密执行实现详细方案\n\n## 目录\n- [一、TEE 技术选型详解](#一tee-技术选型详解)\n- [二、核心机制深度解析](#二核心机制深度解析)\n- [三、业务集成架构](#三业务集成架构)\n- [四、完整技术栈与实现](#四完整技术栈与实现)\n- [五、安全审计与风险控制](#五安全审计与风险控制)\n\n---\n\n## 一、TEE 技术选型详解\n\n### 1.1 TEE 技术全景图\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         TEE 技术栈                              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐            │\n│  │  Intel SGX  │  │  AMD SEV    │  │ ARM TrustZ  │            │\n│  │   (推荐)    │  │             │  │    one      │            │\n│  └──────┬──────┘  └──────┬──────┘  └──────┬──────┘            │\n│         │                 │                 │                   │\n│         └─────────────────┴─────────────────┘                   │\n│                           │                                       │\n│                  ┌────────┴────────┐                             │\n│                  │                 │                             │\n│          ┌───────┴───────┐ ┌───────┴───────┐                  │\n│          │  LibOS 层     │ │  框架层        │                  │\n│          │  (Graphene)   │ │  (OpenEnclave) │                  │\n│          └───────────────┘ └───────────────┘                  │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 1.2 详细技术对比\n\n| 特性 | Intel SGX (推荐) | AMD SEV-SNP | ARM TrustZone | Intel TDX |\n|------|-----------------|-------------|---------------|-----------|\n| **隔离粒度** | Enclave (细粒度) | VM (粗粒度) | Secure World | VM (粗) |\n| **启动延迟** | ~100ms | ~1-2s | <50ms | ~500ms |\n| **内存限制** | 128GB (SGX2) | VM 限制 | 通常 <1GB | VM 限制 |\n| **云支持** | ✅ AWS/GCP/Azure | ✅ AWS/GCP | ❌ 有限 | ✅ 部分 |\n| **开发成本** | 中等 | 低 | 高 | 中等 |\n| **性能损耗** | 5-15% | 2-5% | 5-10% | 3-8% |\n| **适用场景** | Skill 运行时 | 完整应用 | 移动端/设备 | 完整应用 |\n\n### 1.3 针对 Skill 场景的选型建议\n\n#### 🎯 **首选方案：Intel SGX**\n\n**理由：**\n1. **细粒度隔离** - 可以为每个 Skill 单独创建 Enclave\n2. **快速启动** - ~100ms 延迟，适合短生命周期 Skill\n3. **云支持完善** - AWS c6i、GCP n2d、Azure DCsv2/DCsv3\n4. **成熟工具链** - OpenEnclave、Gramine 等 LibOS 支持\n5. **丰富的 SDK** - SGX SDK、Fortanix、Anjuna 等\n\n**硬件要求：**\n- Intel Xeon Scalable 3rd Gen (Ice Lake) 或更高\n- 或支持 SGX 的消费级 CPU (i7-10700K 等)\n\n#### 🔄 **备选方案：Graphene + SGX (降低开发成本)**\n\n如果不想写原生 C/C++ Enclave 代码：\n```\nSkill (Python/TypeScript)\n    ↓\nGraphene LibOS\n    ↓\nSGX Enclave\n    ↓\nIntel SGX Hardware\n```\n\n---\n\n## 二、核心机制深度解析\n\n### 2.1 SGX 内存保护机制\n\n```\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    物理内存 (DRAM)                              │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                               │\n│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │              Enclave Page Cache (EPC)                  │  │\n│  │  (加密保护的内存区域，CPU 硬件管理)                      │  │\n│  │                                                          │  │\n│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │  │\n│  │  │  Skill Code & Data (AES-GCM 加密)               │  │  │\n│  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │  │\n│  │                                                          │  │\n│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │  │\n│  │  │  Sealed Keys (密封存储的密钥)                     │  │  │\n│  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │  │\n│  │                                                          │  │\n│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                                                               │\n│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │              普通应用内存 (未加密)                       │  │\n│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│                                                               │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                    ↑\n            CPU 内存加密引擎\n```\n\n**核心机制：**\n1. **EPC (Enclave Page Cache)** - 专门分配给 Enclave 的加密内存\n2. **MEE (Memory Encryption Engine)** - CPU 内置的 AES-GCM 加密引擎\n3. **Sealing** - 将密钥密封到 CPU，只有同一 CPU 才能解密\n4. **Measured Boot** - 启动时测量 Enclave 代码，生成 MRENCLAVE\n\n### 2.2 远程证明 (RA) 详解\n\n#### 2.2.1 RA 完整流程\n\n```\n┌──────────────┐                    ┌──────────────┐\n│   Verifier   │                    │   Prover     │\n│  (Agent)     │                    │   (TEE)      │\n└──────┬───────┘                    └──────┬───────┘\n       │                                    │\n       │  1. Challenge (nonce + data)       │\n       │───────────────────────────────────>│\n       │                                    │\n       │  2. Enclave 处理                    │\n       │     ┌─────────────────────┐        │\n       │     │ • 验证 Challenge     │        │\n       │     │ • 获取 MRENCLAVE     │        │\n       │     │ • 生成 Quote          │        │\n       │     └─────────────────────┘        │\n       │                                    │\n       │  3. Quote + Attestation Report     │\n       │<───────────────────────────────────│\n       │                                    │\n       │  4. 验证                           │\n       │     ┌─────────────────────┐        │\n       │     │ • 签名 → Intel CA    │        │\n       │     │ • MRENCLAVE 比对     │        │\n       │     │ • Challenge 验证      │        │\n       │     │ • 检查 TCB (硬件配置) │        │\n       │     └─────────────────────┘        │\n       │                                    │\n       │  5. 建立会话密钥 (Sealed)          │\n       │───────────────────────────────────>│\n       │                                    │\n```\n\n#### 2.2.2 Quote 数据结构\n\n```c\n// SGX Quote 结构 (简化版)\nstruct sgx_quote_t {\n    // 头部\n    uint16_t version;\n    uint16_t sign_type;\n    \n    // 证书信息\n    uint32_t epid_group_id;\n    uint8_t qe_svn[4];\n    uint8_t pce_svn[2];\n    \n    // Enclave 信息\n    sgx_report_body_t report_body;  // 包含 MRENCLAVE\n    \n    // 签名\n    uint32_t signature_len;\n    uint8_t signature[];\n};\n\n// Report Body (关键部分)\nstruct sgx_report_body_t {\n    sgx_measurement_t mr_enclave;    // MRENCLAVE\n    sgx_measurement_t mr_signer;      // MRSIGNER\n    sgx_attributes_t attributes;      // 属性 (debug, etc.)\n    sgx_misc_select_t misc_select;\n    uint8_t isv_prod_id[2];\n    uint8_t isv_svn[2];\n    uint8_t report_data[64];          // Challenge + 自定义数据\n};\n```\n\n### 2.3 Sealing (密钥密封) 机制\n\n#### 2.3.1 Sealing 策略\n\n| 策略 | 说明 | 适用场景 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| **SEAL_KEY_POLICY_MRENCLAVE** | 绑定到特定 Enclave 代码 | Skill 密钥，防止被其他代码使用 |\n| **SEAL_KEY_POLICY_MRSIGNER** | 绑定到签名者 | 同一开发者的多个 Skill |\n\n#### 2.3.2 Sealing 流程\n\n```typescript\n// 伪代码：Sealing 操作\ninterface SealedData {\n    ciphertext: Buffer;\n    policy: 'MRENCLAVE' | 'MRSIGNER';\n    keyId: string;\n}\n\nclass SealingManager {\n    // 密封数据\n    async seal(\n        data: Buffer, \n        policy: 'MRENCLAVE' | 'MRSIGNER'\n    ): Promise<SealedData> {\n        // 1. 生成派生密钥 (基于策略)\n        const sealKey = await this.deriveSealKey(policy);\n        \n        // 2. 加密数据\n        const ciphertext = await encryptAESGCM(data, sealKey);\n        \n        // 3. 返回密封数据\n        return {\n            ciphertext,\n            policy,\n            keyId: await this.getKeyId()\n        };\n    }\n    \n    // 解封数据\n    async unseal(sealed: SealedData): Promise<Buffer> {\n        // 1. 验证策略匹配\n        if (!await this.verifyPolicy(sealed.policy)) {\n            throw new Error('Policy mismatch');\n        }\n        \n        // 2. 派生密钥\n        const sealKey = await this.deriveSealKey(sealed.policy);\n        \n        // 3. 解密\n        return await decryptAESGCM(sealed.ciphertext, sealKey);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.4 Skill 加密与分发\n\n#### 2.4.1 加密方案\n\n```\nSkill 开发者\n    │\n    │ 1. 生成对称密钥 (AES-256-GCM)\n    │ 2. 用对称密钥加密 Skill 代码\n    │ 3. 用 Enclave 公钥加密对称密钥\n    │    (Enclave 公钥通过 RA 获取)\n    │\n    └─> IPFS\n        ├─ encrypted_skill: Skill 代码 (AES-GCM)\n        ├─ encrypted_key: 对称密钥 (RSA/ECIES)\n        └─ metadata: Skill 信息、签名、MRENCLAVE\n```\n\n#### 2.4.2 完整加密代码示例\n\n```typescript\nimport * as crypto from 'crypto';\nimport * as ipfs from 'ipfs-http-client';\nimport { ethers } from 'ethers';\n\ninterface SkillMetadata {\n    name: string;\n    version: string;\n    description: string;\n    schema: {\n        input: any;\n        output: any;\n    };\n    author: string;\n    signature: string;\n    mrenclave: string;\n    encryptedKeyCid: string;\n}\n\nclass SkillEncryption {\n    private ipfsClient: any;\n    private provider: ethers.Provider;\n    \n    constructor() {\n        this.ipfsClient = ipfs.create({ url: 'https://ipfs.infura.io:5001' });\n        this.provider = new ethers.JsonRpcProvider('https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/...');\n    }\n    \n    // 加密并上传 Skill\n    async encryptAndUpload(\n        skillCode: string,\n        metadata: Omit<SkillMetadata, 'signature' | 'mrenclave' | 'encryptedKeyCid'>,\n        enclavePublicKey: crypto.KeyObject,  // 通过 RA 获取\n        mrenclave: string,\n        developerPrivateKey: string\n    ): Promise<{ ipfsCid: string; metadata: SkillMetadata }> {\n        \n        // 1. 生成对称密钥\n        const symmetricKey = crypto.randomBytes(32);  // AES-256\n        const iv = crypto.randomBytes(12);  // GCM 推荐 12 字节\n        \n        // 2. 加密 Skill 代码\n        const cipher = crypto.createCipheriv('aes-256-gcm', symmetricKey, iv);\n        let encryptedSkill = cipher.update(skillCode, 'utf8', 'base64');\n        encryptedSkill += cipher.final('base64');\n        const authTag = cipher.getAuthTag();  // GCM 认证标签\n        \n        // 3. 用 Enclave 公钥加密对称密钥\n        const encryptedKey = crypto.publicEncrypt(\n            {\n                key: enclavePublicKey,\n                padding: crypto.constants.RSA_PKCS1_OAEP_PADDING,\n                oaepHash: 'sha256'\n            },\n            symmetricKey\n        );\n        \n        // 4. 上传加密的 Skill 和 Key 到 IPFS\n        const skillCid = await this.ipfsClient.add(JSON.stringify({\n            encryptedSkill,\n            iv: iv.toString('base64'),\n            authTag: authTag.toString('base64')\n        }));\n        \n        const keyCid = await this.ipfsClient.add(encryptedKey);\n        \n        // 5. 构造元数据\n        const fullMetadata: SkillMetadata = {\n            ...metadata,\n            mrenclave,\n            encryptedKeyCid: keyCid.cid.toString()\n        };\n        \n        // 6. 签名元数据\n        const signer = new ethers.Wallet(developerPrivateKey);\n        const signature = await signer.signMessage(\n            JSON.stringify(fullMetadata)\n        );\n        fullMetadata.signature = signature;\n        \n        // 7. 上传元数据\n        const metadataCid = await this.ipfsClient.add(JSON.stringify(fullMetadata));\n        \n        return {\n            ipfsCid: metadataCid.cid.toString(),\n            metadata: fullMetadata\n        };\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 三、业务集成架构\n\n### 3.1 完整系统架构图\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         业务层 (DApp)                               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  ┌────────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐      │\n│  │ Skill 商店     │  │  Agent 平台    │  │  开发者工具    │      │\n│  └────────┬───────┘  └────────┬───────┘  └────────┬───────┘      │\n└───────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼──────────────┘\n            │                     │                     │\n┌───────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼──────────────┐\n│           │                     │                     │              │\n│  ┌────────▼────────┐  ┌────────▼────────┐  ┌────────▼────────┐    │\n│  │   Skill SDK      │  │   Agent SDK      │  │   DevTool SDK    │    │\n│  │  (前端/后端)     │  │  (Agent 运行时)  │  │  (CLI/IDE 插件)  │    │\n│  └────────┬────────┘  └────────┬────────┘  └────────┬────────┘    │\n└───────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼──────────────┘\n            │                     │                     │\n┌───────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼──────────────┐\n│           │                     │                     │              │\n│  ┌────────▼─────────────────────▼─────────────────────▼────────┐    │\n│  │                     Skill Runtime Service                    │    │\n│  ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤    │\n│  │  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐                │    │\n│  │  │  Permission Mgmt │  │  Usage Billing    │                │    │\n│  │  │  (链上验证)       │  │  (USDC 支付)      │                │    │\n│  │  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘                │    │\n│  │  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │    │\n│  │  │              TEE Pool Manager                          │ │    │\n│  │  │  ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ │ │    │\n│  │  │  │ TEE Worker 1 │ │ TEE Worker 2 │ │ TEE Worker 3 │ │ │    │\n│  │  │  │ (SGX Enclave)│ │ (SGX Enclave)│ │ (SGX Enclave)│ │ │    │\n│  │  │  └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ │ │    │\n│  │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │    │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │\n│                                 │                                    │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┐ │\n│  │                              │                                  │ │\n│  │  ┌───────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────┐ │ │\n│  │  │                      区块链层                              │ │ │\n│  │  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤ │ │\n│  │  │  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  │ │ │\n│  │  │  │SkillRegistry │  │  SkillNFT    │  │  Payment     │  │ │ │\n│  │  │  │  (权限管理)   │  │  (所有权)     │  │  (分成)      │  │ │ │\n│  │  │  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  │ │ │\n│  │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │\n│  │                                                                  │ │\n│  │  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │ │\n│  │  │                    IPFS / 去中心化存储                      │ │ │\n│  │  │  - Encrypted Skills                                        │ │ │\n│  │  │  - Metadata                                                │ │ │\n│  │  │  - Usage Logs (IPNS)                                      │ │ │\n│  │  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 3.2 核心服务实现\n\n#### 3.2.1 TEE Pool Manager (TEE 池管理器)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Worker, Job } from 'bullmq';\nimport Redis from 'ioredis';\nimport { SGXEnclave } from './sgx-enclave';\n\ninterface TEEWorker {\n    id: string;\n    enclave: SGXEnclave;\n    status: 'idle' | 'busy' | 'error';\n    currentJob?: string;\n    lastHeartbeat: number;\n}\n\nclass TEEPoolManager {\n    private workers: Map<string, TEEWorker> = new Map();\n    private redis: Redis;\n    private jobQueue: any;\n    \n    constructor() {\n        this.redis = new Redis(process.env.REDIS_URL!);\n        this.jobQueue = new Worker('skill-execution', this.processJob.bind(this));\n        \n        // 初始化 TEE Worker 池\n        this.initWorkers();\n    }\n    \n    private async initWorkers() {\n        // 根据配置启动多个 TEE Worker\n        const workerCount = parseInt(process.env.TEE_WORKER_COUNT || '4');\n        \n        for (let i = 0; i < workerCount; i++) {\n            await this.createWorker(`worker-${i}`);\n        }\n        \n        // 启动健康检查\n        setInterval(() => this.healthCheck(), 30000);\n    }\n    \n    private async createWorker(workerId: string): Promise<TEEWorker> {\n        // 1. 创建 SGX Enclave\n        const enclave = await SGXEnclave.create({\n            enclavePath: './skill_enclave.signed.so',\n            debug: process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production'\n        });\n        \n        // 2. 远程证明\n        const attestation = await enclave.getAttestation();\n        \n        // 3. 注册 Worker\n        const worker: TEEWorker = {\n            id: workerId,\n            enclave,\n            status: 'idle',\n            lastHeartbeat: Date.now()\n        };\n        \n        this.workers.set(workerId, worker);\n        \n        // 4. 缓存 Enclave 测量值\n        await this.redis.set(`enclave:${workerId}:mrenclave`, attestation.mrenclave);\n        \n        return worker;\n    }\n    \n    private async getAvailableWorker(): Promise<TEEWorker> {\n        for (const [, worker] of this.workers) {\n            if (worker.status === 'idle') {\n                worker.status = 'busy';\n                return worker;\n            }\n        }\n        throw new Error('No available TEE workers');\n    }\n    \n    private async processJob(job: Job) {\n        const { skillId, input, callerAddress } = job.data;\n        \n        // 1. 获取可用 Worker\n        const worker = await this.getAvailableWorker();\n        \n        try {\n            // 2. 验证权限 (链上)\n            const hasPermission = await this.verifyPermission(skillId, callerAddress);\n            if (!hasPermission) {\n                throw new Error('Permission denied');\n            }\n            \n            // 3. 获取加密的 Skill\n            const encryptedSkill = await this.fetchEncryptedSkill(skillId);\n            \n            // 4. 在 TEE 中执行\n            const result = await worker.enclave.executeSkill(\n                encryptedSkill,\n                input\n            );\n            \n            // 5. 记录使用\n            await this.recordUsage(skillId, callerAddress);\n            \n            // 6. 释放 Worker\n            worker.status = 'idle';\n            \n            return result;\n        } catch (error) {\n            worker.status = 'idle';\n            throw error;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private async healthCheck() {\n        const now = Date.now();\n        \n        for (const [workerId, worker] of this.workers) {\n            // 检查心跳\n            if (now - worker.lastHeartbeat > 60000) {\n                console.error(`Worker ${workerId} heartbeat timeout`);\n                worker.status = 'error';\n                \n                // 重启 Worker\n                await this.restartWorker(workerId);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private async restartWorker(workerId: string) {\n        const worker = this.workers.get(workerId);\n        if (worker) {\n            try {\n                await worker.enclave.destroy();\n            } catch (e) {\n                // ignore\n            }\n        }\n        \n        await this.createWorker(workerId);\n    }\n    \n    // 对外接口：提交 Skill 执行任务\n    async submitExecution(\n        skillId: string,\n        input: any,\n        callerAddress: string\n    ): Promise<string> {\n        const job = await this.jobQueue.add('execute', {\n            skillId,\n            input,\n            callerAddress\n        });\n        \n        return job.id;\n    }\n    \n    // 对外接口：查询执行结果\n    async getResult(jobId: string): Promise<any> {\n        const job = await this.jobQueue.getJob(jobId);\n        if (!job) throw new Error('Job not found');\n        \n        const state = await job.getState();\n        if (state === 'completed') {\n            return job.returnvalue;\n        } else if (state === 'failed') {\n            throw new Error(job.failedReason);\n        } else {\n            throw new Error('Job still processing');\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private async verifyPermission(skillId: string, address: string): Promise<boolean> {\n        // 调用链上合约验证权限\n        return true;  // 简化\n    }\n    \n    private async fetchEncryptedSkill(skillId: string): Promise<Buffer> {\n        // 从 IPFS 获取加密的 Skill\n        return Buffer.from('');  // 简化\n    }\n    \n    private async recordUsage(skillId: string, callerAddress: string) {\n        // 链上记录使用\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 3.2.2 SkillRegistry 智能合约 (Solidity)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.20;\n\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/ERC721.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/extensions/ERC721URIStorage.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/security/Pausable.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/access/Ownable.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/finance/PaymentSplitter.sol\";\n\ncontract SkillRegistry is ERC721, ERC721URIStorage, Pausable, Ownable, PaymentSplitter {\n    \n    // Skill 结构体\n    struct Skill {\n        uint256 id;\n        string name;\n        address author;\n        string mrenclave;  // Enclave 测量值\n        string ipfsCid;    // 加密 Skill 的 IPFS CID\n        uint256 usageFee;  // 每次使用费 (wei)\n        uint256 royaltyBps; // 版税 (basis points)\n        bool isActive;\n        uint256 totalUses;\n    }\n    \n    // 权限类型\n    enum PermissionType {\n        USE,        // 使用权\n        DERIVE,     // 衍生权\n        EXTEND      // 扩展权\n    }\n    \n    // 权限记录\n    struct Permission {\n        address grantee;\n        PermissionType ptype;\n        uint256 expiresAt;  // 0 = 永久\n        bool isValid;\n    }\n    \n    // 状态变量\n    mapping(uint256 => Skill) public skills;\n    mapping(uint256 => Permission[]) public permissions;\n    mapping(address => uint256[]) public authorSkills;\n    uint256 public skillCounter;\n    \n    // 事件\n    event SkillRegistered(\n        uint256 indexed skillId,\n        address indexed author,\n        string name,\n        string mrenclave\n    );\n    event PermissionGranted(\n        uint256 indexed skillId,\n        address indexed grantee,\n        PermissionType ptype,\n        uint256 expiresAt\n    );\n    event SkillUsed(\n        uint256 indexed skillId,\n        address indexed user,\n        uint256 fee,\n        uint256 timestamp\n    );\n    \n    constructor(\n        address[] memory payees,\n        uint256[] memory shares\n    ) ERC721(\"SkillNFT\", \"SKILL\") PaymentSplitter(payees, shares) {}\n    \n    // 注册新 Skill\n    function registerSkill(\n        string memory name,\n        string memory mrenclave,\n        string memory ipfsCid,\n        uint256 usageFee,\n        uint256 royaltyBps,\n        string memory tokenURI\n    ) external whenNotPaused returns (uint256) {\n        require(royaltyBps <= 10000, \"Royalty too high\");\n        \n        skillCounter++;\n        uint256 skillId = skillCounter;\n        \n        skills[skillId] = Skill({\n            id: skillId,\n            name: name,\n            author: msg.sender,\n            mrenclave: mrenclave,\n            ipfsCid: ipfsCid,\n            usageFee: usageFee,\n            royaltyBps: royaltyBps,\n            isActive: true,\n            totalUses: 0\n        });\n        \n        authorSkills[msg.sender].push(skillId);\n        \n        // Mint NFT\n        _safeMint(msg.sender, skillId);\n        _setTokenURI(skillId, tokenURI);\n        \n        emit SkillRegistered(skillId, msg.sender, name, mrenclave);\n        \n        return skillId;\n    }\n    \n    // 授权使用\n    function grantPermission(\n        uint256 skillId,\n        address grantee,\n        PermissionType ptype,\n        uint256 duration  // 0 = 永久\n    ) external whenNotPaused {\n        require(_isAuthorized(msg.sender, skillId), \"Not authorized\");\n        require(skills[skillId].isActive, \"Skill not active\");\n        \n        uint256 expiresAt = duration > 0 ? block.timestamp + duration : 0;\n        \n        permissions[skillId].push(Permission({\n            grantee: grantee,\n            ptype: ptype,\n            expiresAt: expiresAt,\n            isValid: true\n        }));\n        \n        emit PermissionGranted(skillId, grantee, ptype, expiresAt);\n    }\n    \n    // 验证权限\n    function hasPermission(\n        uint256 skillId,\n        address user,\n        PermissionType ptype\n    ) public view returns (bool) {\n        Skill memory skill = skills[skillId];\n        \n        // Skill 作者或 NFT 持有者有所有权限\n        if (skill.author == user || _isAuthorized(user, skillId)) {\n            return true;\n        }\n        \n        // 检查显式授权\n        for (uint256 i = 0; i < permissions[skillId].length; i++) {\n            Permission memory perm = permissions[skillId][i];\n            if (perm.grantee == user && \n                perm.ptype == ptype && \n                perm.isValid &&\n                (perm.expiresAt == 0 || perm.expiresAt > block.timestamp)) {\n                return true;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        return false;\n    }\n    \n    // 使用 Skill (付费)\n    function useSkill(\n        uint256 skillId,\n        address user\n    ) external payable whenNotPaused returns (bool) {\n        Skill storage skill = skills[skillId];\n        \n        require(skill.isActive, \"Skill not active\");\n        require(hasPermission(skillId, user, PermissionType.USE), \"No permission\");\n        require(msg.value >= skill.usageFee, \"Insufficient fee\");\n        \n        // 支付版税给作者\n        if (skill.royaltyBps > 0) {\n            uint256 royalty = (msg.value * skill.royaltyBps) / 10000;\n            (bool success, ) = skill.author.call{value: royalty}(\"\");\n            require(success, \"Royalty transfer failed\");\n        }\n        \n        skill.totalUses++;\n        \n        emit SkillUsed(skillId, user, msg.value, block.timestamp);\n        \n        return true;\n    }\n    \n    // 获取 Skill 信息\n    function getSkill(uint256 skillId) external view returns (Skill memory) {\n        return skills[skillId];\n    }\n    \n    // 获取作者的所有 Skill\n    function getAuthorSkills(address author) external view returns (uint256[] memory) {\n        return authorSkills[author];\n    }\n    \n    // 暂停/恢复\n    function pause() public onlyOwner {\n        _pause();\n    }\n    \n    function unpause() public onlyOwner {\n        _unpause();\n    }\n    \n    // 重写 ERC721 方法\n    function tokenURI(uint256 tokenId)\n        public\n        view\n        override(ERC721, ERC721URIStorage)\n        returns (string memory)\n    {\n        return super.tokenURI(tokenId);\n    }\n    \n    function supportsInterface(bytes4 interfaceId)\n        public\n        view\n        override(ERC721, ERC721URIStorage)\n        returns (bool)\n    {\n        return super.supportsInterface(interfaceId);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3.3 业务流程时序图\n\n#### 3.3.1 Skill 注册流程\n\n```\n开发者                      SkillRegistry                    IPFS\n  │                            │                            │\n  │  1. 编写 Skill             │                            │\n  │  2. 加密 Skill             │                            │\n  │───────────────────────────────────────────────────────>│\n  │                            │                            │  3. 上传加密 Skill\n  │<───────────────────────────────────────────────────────│\n  │                            │                            │  返回 IPFS CID\n  │                            │                            │\n  │  4. registerSkill()        │                            │\n  │───────────────────────────>│                            │\n  │  - name                    │                            │\n  │  - mrenclave               │                            │\n  │  - ipfsCid                 │                            │\n  │  - usageFee                │                            │\n  │  - royaltyBps              │                            │\n  │  - tokenURI                │                            │\n  │                            │  5. Mint NFT              │\n  │                            │  6. 保存 Skill 信息        │\n  │<───────────────────────────│                            │\n  │  返回 skillId              │                            │\n  │                            │                            │\n```\n\n#### 3.3.2 Skill 使用流程\n\n```\n用户                    Agent                TEE Pool           SkillRegistry           IPFS\n │                      │                     │                      │                     │\n │  1. 选择 Skill       │                     │                      │                     │\n │─────────────────────>│                     │                      │                     │\n │                      │                     │                      │                     │\n │                      │  2. 验证权限         │                      │                     │\n │                      │────────────────────────────────────────────>│                     │\n │                      │                      │                      │  hasPermission()    │\n │                      │<────────────────────────────────────────────│                     │\n │                      │                      │                      │                     │\n │                      │  3. 获取加密 Skill   │                      │                     │\n │                      │───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────>│\n │                      │                      │                      │                     │  cat()\n │                      │<───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│\n │                      │                      │                      │                     │\n │                      │  4. submitExecution │                      │                     │\n │                      │─────────────────────>│                      │                     │\n │                      │                      │  5. 分配 Worker      │                     │\n │                      │                      │  6. 远程证明          │                     │\n │                      │                      │  7. 解密 Skill        │                     │\n │                      │                      │  8. 执行 Skill        │                     │\n │                      │<─────────────────────│                      │                     │\n │                      │                      │                      │                     │\n │                      │  9. useSkill()       │                      │                     │\n │                      │────────────────────────────────────────────>│                     │\n │                      │                      │                      │  扣款 + 分成        │\n │                      │<────────────────────────────────────────────│                     │\n │                      │                      │                      │                     │\n │<─────────────────────│                      │                      │                     │\n │  返回结果            │                      │                      │                     │\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、完整技术栈与实现\n\n### 4.1 技术栈清单\n\n#### 4.1.1 基础设施层\n\n| 组件 | 技术选型 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **TEE 硬件** | Intel SGX (Ice Lake+) | 首选方案 |\n| **云服务** | AWS c6i / GCP n2d | SGX 支持实例 |\n| **K8s** | EKS / GKE | 容器编排 |\n| **消息队列** | BullMQ / Redis | 任务调度 |\n| **缓存** | Redis Cluster | 会话、权限缓存 |\n\n#### 4.1.2 TEE 层\n\n| 组件 | 技术选型 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **TEE SDK** | OpenEnclave | 跨平台 TEE 框架 |\n| **LibOS** | Gramine | 支持未修改应用 |\n| **远程证明** | Intel DCAP | 数据中心认证 |\n| **密封存储** | SGX Sealing API | 密钥持久化 |\n\n#### 4.1.3 区块链层\n\n| 组件 | 技术选型 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **链** | Base / Arbitrum | L2，低 Gas 费 |\n| **合约** | Solidity + Foundry | 开发、测试框架 |\n| **SDK** | viem / wagmi | 前端交互 |\n| **钱包** | MetaMask / WalletConnect | 用户钱包 |\n\n#### 4.1.4 存储层\n\n| 组件 | 技术选型 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **去中心化存储** | IPFS + Filecoin | Skill 代码存储 |\n| **IPFS Pinning** | Pinata / Infura | 持久化 |\n| **索引** | The Graph | Skill 元数据索引 |\n\n#### 4.1.5 应用层\n\n| 组件 | 技术选型 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **前端** | Next.js + React | DApp 前端 |\n| **后端** | Node.js + TypeScript | API 服务 |\n| **Agent 运行时** | 自定义 + TEE | Skill 执行环境 |\n| **监控** | Prometheus + Grafana | 系统监控 |\n\n### 4.2 部署架构 (Kubernetes)\n\n```yaml\n# tee-pool.yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: tee-pool\nspec:\n  replicas: 4\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: tee-worker\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: tee-worker\n    spec:\n      # 需要 SGX 支持的节点\n      nodeSelector:\n        sgx.enabled: \"true\"\n      containers:\n      - name: tee-worker\n        image: skill-tee-worker:latest\n        securityContext:\n          # SGX 设备访问\n          devices:\n          - name: sgx\n            path: /dev/sgx\n          - name: sgx_enclave\n            path: /dev/sgx_enclave\n          - name: sgx_provision\n            path: /dev/sgx_provision\n        resources:\n          limits:\n            sgx.intel.com/epc: \"128Mi\"  # EPC 内存\n        env:\n        - name: SGX_DEBUG\n          value: \"0\"\n        - name: REDIS_URL\n          value: redis://redis:6379\n        ports:\n        - containerPort: 8080\n        livenessProbe:\n          httpGet:\n            path: /health\n            port: 8080\n          initialDelaySeconds: 10\n          periodSeconds: 30\n\n---\n# skill-runtime-service.yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: skill-runtime\nspec:\n  type: ClusterIP\n  selector:\n    app: tee-worker\n  ports:\n  - port: 80\n    targetPort: 8080\n```\n\n### 4.3 开发环境配置\n\n#### 4.3.1 本地 SGX 开发环境 (Docker)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Dockerfile.sgx-dev\nFROM ubuntu:22.04\n\n# 安装 SGX SDK\nRUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y \\\n    build-essential \\\n    wget \\\n    git \\\n    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\n# 安装 Intel SGX SDK\nWORKDIR /opt\nRUN wget https://download.01.org/intel-sgx/sgx-linux/2.22/distro/ubuntu22.04-server/sgx_linux_x64_sdk_2.22.100.3.bin \\\n    && chmod +x sgx_linux_x64_sdk_2.22.100.3.bin \\\n    && echo -e 'yes\\n/opt/intel' | ./sgx_linux_x64_sdk_2.22.100.3.bin\n\n# 安装 OpenEnclave\nRUN wget https://github.com/openenclave/openenclave/releases/download/v0.19.5/openenclave_0.19.5_amd64.deb \\\n    && dpkg -i openenclave_0.19.5_amd64.deb || true \\\n    && apt-get -f install -y\n\n# 安装 Gramine\nRUN git clone https://github.com/gramineproject/gramine.git \\\n    && cd gramine \\\n    && meson setup build/ --buildtype=release -Ddirect=enabled -Dsgx=enabled \\\n    && ninja -C build/ \\\n    && ninja -C build/ install\n\nENV SGX_SDK=/opt/intel/sgxsdk\nENV PATH=$SGX_SDK/bin:$PATH\nENV LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$SGX_SDK/lib64:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n\nWORKDIR /workspace\n```\n\n#### 4.3.2 docker-compose 开发环境\n\n```yaml\n# docker-compose.yml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # SGX 开发环境\n  sgx-dev:\n    build:\n      context: .\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile.sgx-dev\n    devices:\n      - /dev/sgx:/dev/sgx\n      - /dev/sgx_enclave:/dev/sgx_enclave\n      - /dev/sgx_provision:/dev/sgx_provision\n    volumes:\n      - ./:/workspace\n    environment:\n      - SGX_DEBUG=1\n    command: sleep infinity\n\n  # Redis\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    ports:\n      - \"6379:6379\"\n\n  # IPFS (本地开发)\n  ipfs:\n    image: ipfs/kubo:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"5001:5001\"\n      - \"8080:8080\"\n\n  # 本地测试链 (Anvil)\n  anvil:\n    image: foundry:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"8545:8545\"\n    command: anvil --host 0.0.0.0\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、安全审计与风险控制\n\n### 5.1 安全威胁模型\n\n| 威胁 | 风险等级 | 缓解措施 |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| **Enclave 侧信道攻击** | 🔴 高 | 常数时间算法、刷新缓存 |\n| **TEE 硬件漏洞** | 🟡 中 | 及时打微码补丁、TCB 恢复 |\n| **Skill 代码漏洞** | 🔴 高 | 沙箱隔离、代码审计 |\n| **权限滥用** | 🟡 中 | 细粒度权限、使用日志 |\n| **RA 重放攻击** | 🟡 中 | Challenge 机制、时间窗口 |\n| **密钥泄露** | 🔴 高 | Sealing、多签、KMS |\n\n### 5.2 安全审计清单\n\n#### 5.2.1 Enclave 代码审计\n\n- [ ] 常数时间实现，无侧信道泄露\n- [ ] 输入验证，防止缓冲区溢出\n- [ ] 不使用 unsafe 代码（如必要则单独审计）\n- [ ] 正确处理错误，不泄露敏感信息\n- [ ] 最小权限原则，不访问不必要资源\n\n#### 5.2.2 合约代码审计\n\n- [ ] 重入攻击防护 (ReentrancyGuard)\n- [ ] 整数溢出检查 (Solidity 0.8+)\n- [ ] 权限控制正确 (Ownable, AccessControl)\n- [ ] 经济模型验证 (费用、分成计算)\n- [ ] 紧急暂停机制 (Pausable)\n\n#### 5.2.3 部署安全\n\n- [ ] Enclave 在生产模式运行 (SGX_DEBUG=0)\n- [ ] 正确的 MRENCLAVE 白名单\n- [ ] TCB 版本监控与更新\n- [ ] 密钥轮换机制\n- [ ] 审计日志完整\n\n### 5.3 监控与告警\n\n```typescript\n// 安全监控服务\nclass SecurityMonitor {\n    private alerts: Alert[] = [];\n    \n    // 监控指标\n    private metrics = {\n        enclaveRestarts: 0,\n        failedAttestations: 0,\n        permissionDenials: 0,\n        unusualUsagePatterns: 0\n    };\n    \n    async monitorEnclaveHealth(workerId: string) {\n        const worker = await this.getWorker(workerId);\n        \n        // Enclave 重启次数异常\n        if (worker.restartCount > 10) {\n            this.triggerAlert('HIGH', `Worker ${workerId} restarted ${worker.restartCount} times`);\n        }\n        \n        // 远程证明失败率\n        if (worker.failedAttestations > 5) {\n            this.triggerAlert('CRITICAL', `Worker ${workerId} attestation failures`);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    async monitorUsage(skillId: string, userId: string) {\n        const usagePattern = await this.analyzeUsagePattern(skillId, userId);\n        \n        if (usagePattern.isAnomalous) {\n            this.triggerAlert('MEDIUM', `Anomalous usage detected for user ${userId} on skill ${skillId}`);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    private triggerAlert(severity: 'LOW' | 'MEDIUM' | 'HIGH' | 'CRITICAL', message: string) {\n        // 发送告警\n        console.log(`[${severity}] ${message}`);\n        \n        // 严重告警自动暂停相关服务\n        if (severity === 'CRITICAL') {\n            this.pauseService();\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 总结\n\n### 快速启动路线图\n\n1. **Week 1-2** - 本地 SGX 开发环境搭建\n2. **Week 3-4** - 简单 Enclave + RA 原型\n3. **Week 5-6** - Skill 加密/解密 + IPFS\n4. **Week 7-8** - 智能合约开发 + 测试\n5. **Week 9-10** - 业务集成 + 安全审计\n6. **Week 11-12** - 测试网部署 + 优化\n\n### 关键成功因素\n\n- ✅ 选择合适的 TEE 技术 (Intel SGX)\n- ✅ 完善的远程证明机制\n- ✅ 安全的密钥管理 (Sealing)\n- ✅ 细粒度的权限控制\n- ✅ 完整的安全审计\n- ✅ 健壮的监控与告警\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776609128591,"responseId":"02177660912940909495a2a9188cb78a37ff9c09fef68ce502619"}}
