{"type":"message","id":"4531644b","parentId":"f66c2b57","timestamp":"2026-04-19T15:31:09.940Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，目录创建成功。现在让我创建一个完整的原型项目结构和代码。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的！现在让我为你创建一个完整的原型项目结构：\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_qb14molylwcidcl6snpon8a0","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-codus/skill-tee-prototype/README.md","content":"# TEE + 加密执行原型\n\n## 目录\n- [阶段 1：环境准备](#阶段-1环境准备)\n- [阶段 2：最小原型（仿真模式）](#阶段-2最小原型仿真模式)\n- [阶段 3：业务集成](#阶段-3业务集成)\n- [阶段 4：真实硬件部署](#阶段-4真实硬件部署)\n\n---\n\n## 快速开始\n\n```bash\n# 安装依赖\nnpm install\n\n# 启动仿真模式原型\nnpm run start:simulation\n\n# 运行测试\nnpm run test\n```\n\n---\n\n## 阶段 1：环境准备\n\n### 1.1 项目结构\n```\nskill-tee-prototype/\n├── README.md\n├── package.json\n├── docker-compose.yml\n├── .env.example\n├── contracts/              # 智能合约\n├── enclave-sim/           # TEE 仿真实现\n├── services/               # 后端服务\n├── frontend/               # 前端 DApp\n└── scripts/                # 部署脚本\n```\n\n### 1.2 安装依赖\n```bash\n# Node.js\ncurl -fsSL https://fnm.vercel.app/install | bash\nfnm install 20\n\n# Foundry (Solidity 开发)\ncurl -L https://foundry.paradigm.xyz | bash\nfoundryup\n\n# Docker & Docker Compose\n# 参考：https://docs.docker.com/get-docker/\n```\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776612628710,"responseId":"0217766126301420d36d2a85d6fd6ee9f6173d32f630e1e12d42c"}}
