{"type":"message","id":"7b5e377f","parentId":"13a50959","timestamp":"2026-04-19T15:32:24.252Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，现在让我创建仿真模式的 TEE 实现，这样用户可以在没有真实 SGX 硬件的情况下测试。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在让我创建仿真模式的 TEE 实现（无需真实 SGX 硬件）：\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e1nj0a2326qc9ftyd4wvl4pf","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-codus/skill-tee-prototype/enclave-sim/types.ts","content":"// TEE 相关类型定义\n\nexport interface EnclaveConfig {\n  debug?: boolean;\n  enclavePath?: string;\n}\n\nexport interface AttestationReport {\n  mrenclave: string;\n  mrsigner: string;\n  isDebuggable: boolean;\n  timestamp: number;\n  quote: string;\n  signature: string;\n}\n\nexport interface SealedData {\n  ciphertext: string;\n  policy: 'MRENCLAVE' | 'MRSIGNER';\n  keyId: string;\n  iv: string;\n  authTag: string;\n}\n\nexport interface EncryptedSkill {\n  ciphertext: string;\n  iv: string;\n  authTag: string;\n  encryptedKey: string;\n  mrenclave: string;\n}\n\nexport interface SkillExecutionResult {\n  success: boolean;\n  output?: any;\n  error?: string;\n  executionTime: number;\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776612716097,"responseId":"02177661271653309495a2a9188cb78a37ff9c09fef68cea8baf7"}}
